  "faqs": [
    {
      "question": "What size events can Galleria Marchetti accommodate?",
      "answer": "Our venues are designed to host a wide range of events, from intimate gatherings to large-scale celebrations. Flexible indoor and outdoor spaces allow us to adapt layouts based on your guest count and event style.",
      "source_url": "https://www.galleriamarchetti.com/",
      "snapshot_id": null
    },
    {
      "question": "Can we host both the ceremony and reception on-site?",
      "answer": "Yes. Each space's own outdoor ceremony setting is designed to transition naturally into cocktail hour and the reception that follows, so your guests stay together in one setting for the whole celebration instead of traveling between locations.",
      "source_url": "https://www.galleriamarchetti.com/",
      "snapshot_id": null
    },
    {
      "question": "What happens if the weather doesn't cooperate?",
      "answer": "The Pavilion has a beautifully appointed indoor ceremony location, with a matching arbor to the outdoor one, so a rained-out ceremony still moves forward smoothly rather than getting improvised at the last minute.",
      "source_url": "https://www.galleriamarchetti.com/",
      "snapshot_id": null
    },
    {
      "question": "Do you host weekday or evening events?",
      "answer": "Yes. Galleria Marchetti welcomes weekday events and often offers seasonal incentives or special pricing for weekday bookings.",
      "source_url": "https://www.galleriamarchetti.com/",
      "snapshot_id": null
    },
    {
      "question": "Do you provide event planning or coordination support?",
      "answer": "Our experienced team works closely with clients throughout the planning process, offering guidance on space selection, layout options, and event logistics to ensure a smooth experience.",
      "source_url": "https://www.galleriamarchetti.com/",
      "snapshot_id": null
    },
    {
      "question": "Can we work with our own vendors?",
      "answer": "To ensure a high level of quality and a seamless event experience, Galleria Marchetti works with a curated list of trusted vendors. Our team is happy to share approved options and guide you through selections that align with your vision while ensuring smooth execution on event day.",
      "source_url": "https://www.galleriamarchetti.com/",
      "snapshot_id": null
    },
    {
      "question": "Can we do a menu tasting before we book our final selections?",
      "answer": "Yes. A complimentary tasting for up to four guests is available once your event is booked, limited to plated dinner selections, and must be scheduled in advance.",
      "source_url": "https://www.galleriamarchetti.com/",
      "snapshot_id": null
    },
    {
      "question": "Does Galleria Marchetti provide audio/visual equipment, like a sound system?",
      "answer": "No, AV services are arranged through outside providers. The venue's team can help with recommendations and coordination, but the equipment, setup, and technical support are the AV provider's responsibility, so give them advance notice.",
      "source_url": "https://www.galleriamarchetti.com/",
      "snapshot_id": null
    },
    {
      "question": "Do you offer a children's menu, or accommodate vendor meals?",
      "answer": "Yes to both. Special menu options and pricing are available for children ages 3 through 11, and for your event's vendors, though Galleria Marchetti doesn't serve alcoholic beverages to vendors while they're working your event.",
      "source_url": "https://www.galleriamarchetti.com/",
      "snapshot_id": null
    },
    {
      "question": "How do we get started?",
      "answer": "The best first step is to reach out and tell us about your event. Our team will provide availability, capacity details, and next steps to help bring your vision to life.",
      "source_url": "https://www.galleriamarchetti.com/",
      "snapshot_id": null
    }
  ],
